  "title": "She Threatened A 1-Star Review. The Footage Told A Different Story.",
  "script": "A woman stormed up to my register holding a half-eaten sandwich and demanded a full refund plus a free meal, claiming she found a hair before two bites. I offered a standard refund. She refused, raised her phone, and threatened to post a one-star review with photos unless I comped her next five visits. I said policy required me to check the kitchen cameras first for any goodwill comp over ten dollars. She agreed, smirking. The footage showed her pulling a hair from her own ponytail, then tucking it under the lettuce thirty seconds before calling me over. I printed a single frame, slid it across the counter, and asked whether she still wanted to post. She left without the refund, the free meal, or the review. Turns out the camera had the strongest review.",
